  "body": "https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/embedded-content.html#the-source-element\r\n\r\n> The source element supports dimension attributes\\. These attributes can map to the aspect\\-ratio property as well as the rendered dimensions of sibling img element, if source element's parent is a picture element and source element's source set is returned as a result of update the source set for that sibling img\\.\r\n\r\n\"source\", \"picture\", \"img\" are marked up with `<span>` but should be `<code>`",
